== Not run on this base ==
Yosys read_slang of the whole SoC: elaborating the combinational vector
  unit on this base takes hours (#41 saw > 3 h). On the fork (with the
  element-serial vector unit) the SoC elaborates in 5 s with this unit
  (u_muldiv: 4 $mul, no $div; fork PR CantelopePeel/museRISC#14).
Linux boot: upstream main livelocks after /init without #36. With #36's
  RTL applied locally the soc_tb boot was still in the kernel's silent
  early phase after 2 h (this base simulates at ~17k cycles/s; a boot
  needs ~510M cycles) and was stopped. The same unit boots to
  MUSERISC_LINUX_BOOT_OK at 510,301,199 cycles on the fork (with #36
  and the element-serial vector unit).
